{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Disclaimer.png?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get easily frustrated, consider giving this game a pass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get stuck, well... <i>skill issue</i>. Don't worry, it\u2019s not the game, it\u2019s <strong>you</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Git Gud, and victory will taste sweet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Otherwise, prepare for a rage filled adventure!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will die many, <strong>MANY</strong> times. <i>Have fun!</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Run.gif?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Gamw.png?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ReDrop</strong> is a pixel-art precision platformer where dying isn\u2019t failure, it\u2019s progress. Each death leaves a platform behind to help you overcome obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sounds easy?</i> Just keep dying and you\u2019ll reach the end.<br><br>Except\u2026 your own platforms can also trap you. Easy jumps turn impossible. You might smack your head on a platform you just created. One unlucky death can block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>So, ready to drop in?</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Redrop.gif?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Beg.png?t=1749560091\" />It all starts inside a strange capsule in a lab, where a mysterious purple slime begins to mutate\u2026 and then <strong>BOOM</strong>!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Start.gif?t=1749560091\" />Suddenly, you\u2019re lost in an unknown world. Explore! Climb through weird environments, dodge deadly traps and creatures, and find your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/end.png?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s the fate of the little purple slime? Try to unlock all endings, even the secret one, or rage quit trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s harder than it looks, and you\u2019ll die... a lot. Seriously, a <strong>LOT</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you give in to rage before beating them all? <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/chall.png?t=1749560091\" />If you really want to suffer, we encourage you to speedrun the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can measure the time you\u2019ve wasted thanks to the in-game timers: one measures the time for the whole gameplay, one resets after every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So don\u2019t worry! Even if you keep dying for a whole day, you\u2019ll be able to see for how long you weren\u2019t able to complete the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Bukonfuma.png?t=1749560091\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783370?t=1749560091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/ddd638cc0c8319f3574fed4cd6918ed421411870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749560091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/e0b4f44507b464bef369a21f35719e032fac344f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749560091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/e0b4f44507b464bef369a21f35719e032fac344f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749560091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3789410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Disclaimer.png?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get easily frustrated, consider giving this game a pass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you get stuck, well... <i>skill issue</i>. Don't worry, it\u2019s not the game, it\u2019s <strong>you</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Git Gud, and victory will taste sweet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Otherwise, prepare for a rage filled adventure!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will die many, <strong>MANY</strong> times. <i>Have fun!</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/Run.gif?t=1749560091\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extra